    "created_at": "2017-12-11T12:54:53Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-12-11T12:55:02Z",
    "body": "From what I've seen in the wild, convention seems to be:\r\n\r\n1. If [conditions], then [actions].\r\n1. Otherwise, if [conditions], then [actions].\r\n1. Otherwise, [actions].\r\n\r\nOr:\r\n\r\n1. If [conditions], then:\r\n    1. …\r\n1. Otherwise, if [conditions], then:\r\n    1. …\r\n1. Otherwise:\r\n    1. …",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
