    "created_at": "2020-05-18T06:57:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-05-18T06:57:12Z",
    "body": "Once you have \"Otherwise\", \"then\" is no longer used. So it's:\r\n\r\n1. If …, then ….\r\n2. Otherwise, if …, ….\r\n3. Otherwise, ….\r\n\r\nThis does seem somewhat worthwhile adding at this point.",
