    "created_at": "2023-07-18T04:09:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-07-18T04:09:33Z",
    "body": "> Once you have \"Otherwise\", \"then\" is no longer used.\r\n\r\nI don't understand the logic behind this. It rubs my brain the wrong way to see \"if ..., then ...\" used in one line, and \"if ..., ...\" used on the next.",
