    "created_at": "2023-07-26T13:21:21Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-07-26T13:21:42Z",
    "body": "Often you wouldn't have \"Otherwise, if ..., ...\" as we do use early returns commonly, but as far as I can tell that's the convention we've been using for quite a while now when \"Otherwise, if\" or \"Otherwise\" is used. It also reads better I think.",
